      "text": "Static Next.js dashboard on Vercel. The local portfolio uses\nIndexedDB. Browser preferences use localStorage.",
      "originalText": "Static Next.js dashboard on Vercel. The local portfolio uses\nIndexedDB. Browser preferences use localStorage.",
